          "title": "COURS (AUTOMNE) / COURSES (FALL)",
          "text": "<p>Make your own website in a few clicks! Mobirise helps you cut down development time by providing you with a flexible website editor with a drag and drop interface. MobiRise Website Builder creates responsive, retina and mobile friendly websites in a few clicks. Mobirise is one of the easiest website development tools available today. It also gives you the freedom to develop as many websites as you like given the fact that it is a desktop app.</p>",
          "button": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg btn-default\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\">LEARN MORE</a>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 30, 2015",
          "_name": "content5",
          "_anchor": "content5-5d",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": true
          },
          "title": "CHM2501 - Chimie biologique",
          "meta": "Cours de premier cycle en chimie - Faculté des arts et des sciences, U. de Montréal<br>Undergraduate chemistry course - Arts and Science Faculty, U. of Montreal<br>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_anchor": "header3-5g",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "text": "<p>\n</p><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Notions de l'organisation chimique dans les systèmes biologiques. Structure, propriétés physiques, réactivité, analyse et applications des biomolécules. Introduction aux domaines de la chimie biophysique, bio-analytique, bio-organique et bio-inorganique.</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Notions of chemical organization in biological systems. Structure, physical properties, reactivity, biomolecules analysis and applications. Introduction to the fields of biophysical, bioanalytical, bioorganic and bioinorganic chemistry.</div>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_anchor": "content1-5f",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg btn-danger\" href=\"https://admission.umontreal.ca/cours-et-horaires/cours/chm-2501/\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">DETAILS</a> ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "buttons1",
          "_anchor": "buttons1-5h",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "_params": {
            "showMeta": true
          },
          "title": "<br>CHM2302 - Chimie organique III",
          "meta": "Cours de premier cycle en chimie - Faculté des arts et des sciences, U. de Montréal Undergraduate chemistry course - Arts and Science Faculty, U. of Montreal",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "header3",
          "_styles": {
            "H3": {
              "font-size": "20px"
            }
          },
          "_anchor": "header3-5k",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "text": "<p>\n</p><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Les composés conjugués; les polyènes et les aromatiques. Spectroscopie UV-visible. Substitution électrophile aromatique et réactions concertées. Composés d'importance biologique. Spectroscopie RMN avancée.</div><div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Conjugated compounds; polyenes and aromatics. UV-visible spectroscopy. Electrophilic aromatic substitution and concerted reactions. Biologically significant compounds. Advanced NMR spectroscopy.</div>",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "content1",
          "_anchor": "content1-5l",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "buttons": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg btn-danger\" href=\"https://admission.umontreal.ca/cours-et-horaires/cours/chm-2302/\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">DETAILS</a> ",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "buttons1",
          "_anchor": "buttons1-5m",
          "_sourceTheme": "default"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "msg-box3",
          "_styles": {
