          "title1": "TRAVEL AWARDS GRANTED FOR PROTEIN SOCIETY SYMPOSIUM - POSTER PRESENTATIONS",
          "caption1": "&nbsp;Congratulations to Adem H.-Parisien and Jonathan Besna for their Protein Society Travel Awards Grants. The Protein Society Annual Symposium 2022 (PS36) takes place July 7-10, in San Francisco, California.<br>",
