          "text1": "<strong>ADRESSE / ADDRESS</strong><br><br>Université de Montréal \n<br>Département de Chimie<br><a href=\"https://campusmil.umontreal.ca/\" class=\"text-warning text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Campus MIL</a> - Local B-6227&nbsp;<br>1375 Ave.Thérèse-Lavoie-Roux<br>Montreal, Qc, Canada,&nbsp;H2V 0B3&nbsp;<br>\n<br><b>CONTACT</b><br>Phone: +1 <a href=\"tel:+1 (514) 343-2124 \" class=\"text-warning\">(514) 343-2124 </a>\n<br>Fax: +1 <a href=\"tel:+1 (514) 343-7586 \" class=\"text-warning\">(514) 343-7586 </a>\n<br>@ :<a href=\"mailto:joelle.pelletier@umontreal.ca\" class=\"text-warning\"> joelle.pelletier@umontreal.ca&nbsp;</a><br><br>",
          "text2": "<p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><b>LIENS / LINKS</b></p><p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><b><br></b></p><p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><b><a href=\"http://www.proteo.ca/en/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">PROTEO</a></b></p><p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><u><a href=\"https://chimie.umontreal.ca/repertoire-departement/professeurs/professeur/in/in14450/sg/Joelle%20Pelletier/\" class=\"text-gray\" target=\"_blank\">Joelle Pelletier - Chemistry Dpt.</a></u><br></p><p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><u><a href=\"http://ccvc.research.mcgill.ca/home.html\" class=\"text-warning\">Centre in Green Chemistry and Catalysis (<b>CGCC</b>)</a></u></p><p class=\"mbr-contacts__text\"><u><a href=\"https://www.affiniteinstruments.com/\" class=\"text-gray\" target=\"_blank\">Affinity Instruments</a></u></p>",
