          "title6": "FIRST PLACE POSTER PRESENTATION AWARDS FOR THE 21st PROTEO SYMPOSIUM 2022",
          "caption6": "Congratulations to Stella Cellier-Goetghebeur and Jonathan Besna for first place prizes at the 2022 PROTEO Symposium, held on May 13th.&nbsp;<br><br><br>",
