          "title": "MODERN STYLES",
          "meta": "By John Smith posted July 30, 2015",
          "text": "<p>Mobirise has provided for website developers a growing library of modern blocks which can be used either partially or in full for every website developed through the builder.</p>",
          "button": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-lg btn-default\" href=\"index.html\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">FRANCAIS</a>",
