          "title2": "NEW LAB MEMBERS<div></div>",
          "caption2": "The Pelletier lab is happy to welcome a new post-doc, Ahmad Salehi, and a new master's student, Mehdi Zemouri. Ahmad and Mehdi will work on the P450 project. Ahmad recently defended his thesis after completing his PhD in the Dave Palmer Lab!&nbsp;<br><br>The Pelletier lab also welcomes two interns for summer 2026, Eugénie Daubas-Prade (P450 project) and Sai Rishissen Ritchie Ittoo (DfrB project).<br>",
          "button2": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"research.html\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-primary\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">MORE ABOUT THE RESEARCH PROJECTS</a>",
          "media3": {
