          "title3": "SCIENCE COMMUNICATION WORKS",
          "caption3": "The research project of Samy Faraj, one of our PhD students, was featured in an episode of the podcast Recherche en cours, which highlights the research activities of graduate students in Quebec.",
          "button3": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://baladoquebec.ca/recherche-en-cours/episode-1-la-resilience-de-nos-systemes\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-info\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">LISTEN TO THE EPISODE</a>",
