          "title4": "RECENT ARTICLES",
          "caption4": "'Indigo Formation as a Predictor of Non-Native Aromatic Hydroxylation in Cytochrome P450 BM3' was published in ACS Catalysis. \n<br>_________________________\n<br>'From binding to catalysis: emergence of a rudimentary enzyme conferring intrinsic antibiotic resistance' was published in Molecular Biology and Evolution.&nbsp;<br>",
          "button4": "<a data-app-btn=\"true\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=FYazIkcAAAAJ&amp;hl=fr\" class=\"mbr-buttons__btn btn btn-wrap btn-xs-lg btn-success\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" target=\"_blank\">READ THE ARTICLES</a>",
