          "title5": "ALI FENDRI, TALK PRESENTATION FOR CGCC'S 12th ANNUAL SYMPOSIUM",
          "caption5": "Congratulations to Ali for his oral presentation: Cofactor-free biocatalysis flow system of P450 BM3 enzyme immobilization. The event was held at the MIL campus on May 20th.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>",
